    "copper mountain": {
      "status": "ok",
      "resort": "Copper Mountain",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-13 05:00:00",
      "note": "Good morning, Copper Mountain! It officially feels like spring out there. Today, expect mostly sunny skies with a breezy southwest wind, with gusts reaching the 30-mph range. We may see a few flurries this afternoon, though little to no accumulation is expected. Looking ahead, snow showers are possible tomorrow, with 1 to 3 inches of accumulation. Might be time to start those snow dances again—a few inches of fresh would be a welcome change of pace. Yesterday marked your final opportunity this season to ride Storm King, Timberline Express, Sierra, Rendezvous, and Woodward Express . In addition to these lift closures, a significant amount of terrain has now closed for the season . For the most up-to-date information, please check the Winter Trail & Lift Report | Copper Mountain Resort . For real-time updates, follow along on our Instagram channel by clicking the link here.",
