      "resort": "Snowbird",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-13 05:26:55",
      "note": "Gooooood morning Snowbird! It’s Owen, with your snow report for Monday. Last night we got 4” of snow. Wow, does that feel good to say. It snowed . Feels like a breath of fresh air. Today, there’s a potential for more snow showers, but accumulation of less than half an inch is expected. We’ll have a high of 42° and partly sunny skies, similar to yesterday. Today is another good day to wear that shell and maybe one less layer than usual underneath. Expect some variable conditions today, groomers will likely be skiing the best. Also, in case you haven’t heard, The 2026 Blister Summit starts tonight! There will be demos on tons of brands, chances for public and professional athletes to test gear, nightly panel sessions and sweet après events. Register now to claim your spot. As a reminder, we have closed Chickadee Bowl for construction on a new lift . Please stay out of that area for the foreseeable future as getting smacked by a construction vehicle or falling in a ditch would not make for a great day. If you normally park at the top of Chickadee, the bypass road just further down Entry 4 makes for a good parking alternative. ALL uphill travel is closed. Don’t be that guy (or gal). Please remember to ski and ride in control, if you don’t, you’re gonna have a bad time. It's Surf Season at The Bird, so to quote that one surfer guy, \"drop in, just smack the lip, wapow.\" Go get pitted today. #GMTB",
